# Line endings: LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, git on Windows converts to CRLF on checkout, and every file
# then shows as wholly modified the first time it is touched on another
# machine — which buries real changes in noise and makes `git blame` useless.
# The app is served as static files, so LF everywhere is also what actually
# ships.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalise binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
